'''
primary = [root / 'AGENTS.md', root / 'HANDOFF.md', root / 'START_HERE.md',
           root / 'resume-2026-09-28-001/SESSION.md', base / 'RESOURCE_COORDINATION.md']
old = {path: path.read_bytes() for path in primary}
header = f'''**MAJOR STEP026 - CONSUMER005 COMPLETE SOURCE AUDIT ACCEPTED; FAST BEFORE/AFTER REVIEW SOURCES ACCEPTED; ISOLATED BASELINE RUNTIME NEXT, CANONICAL HOLD PRESERVED.**
Recorded {stamp}. Owner ends2026-10-02T22:36:15Z. Read [checkpoint026](resume-2026-10-01-30h-001/30H_RESUME_CHECKPOINT_026.md), HANDOFF, START_HERE and newest SESSION. Consumer005 complete different source peer5a283 accepts source/causal preparation with Path/runtime limits; 19+5 direct sibling methods remain UNRUN. Future harness design is frozen author-only, with one-class reader, peer schema/cap and event receipt blockers; no implementation/cap increase approved. BEFORE006 delta peer4b456 and AFTER002 peer4bb5 source-only accepted; mains and fresh actual phases absent. Next GG5 copied14 baseline proves oldConsumer003 only. Prepare callbacks before600s original context; bound/late90s, unit450+after60, resources60s throughspawn; freeze primarydocs during before/unit/after. Gate00911:55 finite observation one13-node acceptance/twofailures/44partitions5562unaccepted/no fixed continuation002; canonical/Pro3 holds and no soleexecutorACK/lease/quiet. PubNative author draft178891/all31witness32489 is unfrozen/no runtime/current cap or native proof. Preserve all science/twins/epoch/attempts/history/reserves/no-public/no-replay; monitor restore at closeout. Earlier bytes remain exact history.

'''.encode()
handoff = re.sub(r'\]\(([^)]+)\)', lambda m: '](resume-2026-10-01-30h-001/' + m.group(1) + ')',
                 body.replace(body.split('\n')[0], '# Current pro2 handoff - major step026', 1)).encode()
start = b'''# Start here

Read [HANDOFF](HANDOFF.md), [checkpoint026](resume-2026-10-01-30h-001/30H_RESUME_CHECKPOINT_026.md) and newest [SESSION](resume-2026-09-28-001/SESSION.md).

Consumer005 passed a complete independent source and causal-test preparation audit. Its two direct test classes contain 24 prepared methods; actual collection and results remain unknown. Its new isolated harness design has source-reader and event-cap blockers and is not approved for implementation.

Fast BEFORE006 and AFTER002 review utility sources passed their scoped independent reviews. Next is the prepared 14-method copied Consumer003 baseline only, after this documentation peer and ready callbacks. All fresh actual phases are absent. Keep the original context600s/bound-late90s/resource60s and fix primary docs throughout before/unit/after; preserve the spent old metadata attempt.

Publication/native implementation is still unfrozen authoring under Root008/009 with all hard caps unchanged. Current Raw00458, Consumer00524, metadata24+2 and Native111 tests remain unrun. Canonical live actions and Pro3 remain held without sole-executor ACK, lease or quiet. Owner ends2026-10-02T22:36:15Z; monitor restoration is due at closeout.
'''
entry = f'''\n\n## {stamp} - ROOT MAJOR026: complete Consumer005 source peer and fast review sources; copied baseline runtime next

[Checkpoint026](../resume-2026-10-01-30h-001/30H_RESUME_CHECKPOINT_026.md). Consumer005 peer5a283 source/causal preparation only:1737 finiteinputs/884payload/847pairs/14activeinputs; all19 oldmethod ASTs exact+5 new/direct19+5 siblingclasses/actualcollectionNone/all24UNRUN/Pathlimits. Future harness design author-only:oldoneclass reader, sourcepeer38keys2553985 versus12/2MiB, three eventfamilies780 lowerbound276146 exceeds262144 by14002; pending choices/no implementation/capchange. BEFORE006peer4b456 delta-only overfull005peer30d1 and AFTER002peer4bb5 source-only accepted; prior refusals preserved/mainUNRUN/transitive bindings d8f77-11384-dd229 in actual evidence. Fresh actual auth/capture/whole/ACK/unit absent; next GG5 copied14 oldConsumer003 only, not currentRaw4 closure. Callback preparation before600s timer/boundlate90/unit450+after60/resource60throughspawn/docsfixedspan/no replay-retimestamp. ExactMeta17/14/20 Whole15/19/30 driver20 physical18/originalwholecontext-byteidenticalbridge/metadataafterowncontext/noJUnit. Raw58/Consumer24/Metadata24+2/Native111UNRUN. Gate00911:55 finitef95/b0b2 unchangedpins1governance13/twofailedheavy/44partitions5562unaccepted/no fixedcontinuation002/no globalabsence-cause-newfull742263proof. PubNative unfrozen authorreportall31typed32489/578nodes/common178891 under008/009/hardcaps unchanged/currentfixture-entry-bounds-sourcepeer pending. Canonical-Pro3HELD/no soleACK/delivery/lease/quiet/no unrelatedstop/science-twins-epoch-history-attempts-reserves-no-public-no-push-no-replay/pipedGO/noNonInteractive/monitorrestorecloseout. DifferentDoc26peer ahead.
'''.encode()
resource = f'''\n\n### {stamp} - major026: complete source peers before isolated baseline timer

[Checkpoint026](30H_RESUME_CHECKPOINT_026.md). BEFORE006/AFTER002 scoped source peers accepted/mainUNRUN; actual fresh phases absent. Ready callbacks precede original600s capture; boundlate90/unit450+after60/resources60throughspawn and primarydocsfixedspan. GG5 copied14 is oldConsumer003 baseline only. CurrentRaw58/Consumer24/Metadata24+2/Native111UNRUN. No new resource authorization, lease, durable quiet or soleexecutorACK. PubNative draft178891/all31typed32489 author-only with allcaps unchanged. Canonical/Pro3 holds; keeperconsumed/monitorrestorecloseout.
'''.encode()
links = []
for path, data in [(primary[0], header), (primary[1], handoff), (primary[2], start),
                   (checkpoint, body.encode()), (primary[3], entry), (primary[4], resource)]:
    for target in re.findall(r'\]\(([^)]+)\)', data.decode()):
        resolved = (path.parent / target).resolve()
        assert resolved == checkpoint.resolve() or resolved.is_file(), (str(path), target)
        links.append(dict(document=path.relative_to(root).as_posix(), target=target, resolved_path=str(resolved)))
def once(path, data):
    path.parent.mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)
    with path.open('xb') as stream:
        stream.write(data)
        stream.flush()
        os.fsync(stream.fileno())
def row(path):
    data = path.read_bytes()
    return dict(path=path.relative_to(root).as_posix(), bytes=len(data), sha256=sha(data))
enc = lambda value: (json.dumps(value, indent=2, sort_keys=True, ensure_ascii=True, allow_nan=False) + '\n').encode('ascii')
for name, data in inputs.items():
    assert (base / name).read_bytes() == data
    once(copies / 'resume-2026-10-01-30h-001' / name, data)
for path, data in old.items():
    once(before / path.relative_to(root), data)
once(checkpoint, body.encode())
for path, data in {primary[0]: header + old[primary[0]], primary[1]: handoff, primary[2]: start}.items():
    assert path.read_bytes() == old[path]
    path.write_bytes(data)
for path, data in [(primary[3], entry), (primary[4], resource)]:
    assert path.read_bytes() == old[path]
    with path.open('ab') as stream:
        stream.write(data)
baseline = []
for path, data in old.items():
    proof = 'exact_before_copy'
    if path.name == 'AGENTS.md':
        assert path.read_bytes().endswith(data)
        proof = 'exact_retained_suffix'
    if path.name in ('SESSION.md', 'RESOURCE_COORDINATION.md'):
        assert path.read_bytes().startswith(data)
        proof = 'exact_retained_prefix'
    baseline.append(dict(primary=path.relative_to(root).as_posix(), before=row(before / path.relative_to(root)), proof=proof))
once(base / 'DOCS_REFRESH_BASELINE_026.json', enc(dict(schema_version=1, created_utc=stamp, files=baseline)))
pairs = [dict(original=row(base / name), copy=row(copies / 'resume-2026-10-01-30h-001' / name)) for name in inputs]
once(base / 'DOCS_REFRESH_INPUTS_026.json', enc(dict(schema_version=1, created_utc=stamp, inputs=pairs)))
declared = [*primary, checkpoint, base / 'DOCS_REFRESH_BASELINE_026.json', base / 'DOCS_REFRESH_INPUTS_026.json',
            *[before / path.relative_to(root) for path in primary],
            *[copies / 'resume-2026-10-01-30h-001' / name for name in inputs]]
facts = dict(Consumer005_complete_source_only_with_Path_runtime_limits=True,
             current24_Consumer005_methods_unrun=True, future_harness_design_unapproved=True,
             fast_before_after_source_peers_accepted_mains_unrun=True, actual_fresh_phases_absent=True,
             next_GG5_14_is_oldConsumer003_baseline_only=True, primary_docs_fixed_during_actual_proofs=True,
             Gate009_finite_observation_no_new_runtime_acceptance=True, PubNative_draft_author_only=True,
             canonical_Pro3_holds_no_soleACK_lease_quiet=True)
audit = dict(schema_version=1, checkpoint=26, created_utc=stamp,
             status='AWAITING_INDEPENDENT_DOCUMENTATION_REVIEW', files=[row(path) for path in declared],
             actual_input_count=len(pairs), maintained_links=links, facts=facts)
once(base / 'DOCS_REFRESH_AUDIT_026.json', enc(audit))
print(json.dumps(dict(checkpoint_sha256=sha(checkpoint.read_bytes()), audit_sha256=sha(enc(audit)),
                      declared_files=len(declared), input_pairs=len(pairs), links=len(links))))
